<script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/interface/NewsvoteDWR.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/engine.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/news/newscontent.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/ajax.js"></script><form name="_newscontent_fromname">
<div class="show-news01"><h5 times new roman";" style=" font-size: 30px;color:#333333;line-height:42px;margin-bottom:10px; text-align: center">School of Aerospace Science and Technology</h5></div>
    <div id="vsb_content" style="margin-bottom: 40px;font-size: 18px;color: #333333;line-height:30px;text-align:justify;display: block;margin: 30px auto;max-width: 1080px; min-height:800px;"><div class="v_news_content">
<p style="margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">T</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">he School of Aerospace Science and Technology</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">SAST</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">) </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">was</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> founded</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> on July 14, 2013</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">T</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">o meet the needs of national space development</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">, it</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> is a major initiative of Xidian University to support the development of </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">the </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">superior disciplines</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> of </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">aero</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">space electronic information. Bao Weimin, </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">the </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">academician of Chinese Academy of Sciences and director of Science and Technology Commission of China Aerospace Science and Technology Corporation, </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">is</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> specially appointed as the</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">dean</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">of the school. SAST </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">focuses </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">on the frontier research in </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">the </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">field of aerospace science. Supported by the discipline construction, the fundamental goal of SAST is to cultivate the innovative people </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">urgently</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> needed in the development of the state astronautic technology. It serves national development demand with the research results and </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">first-class </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">talent</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">s</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">and</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">closely </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">combine</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">s</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> the fundamentality, innovativeness and engineering quality.</span></p>
