&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">evelopment project of the NSFC, and the first </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">to carry out the </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">major research plan of the NSFC. SAST has </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">attracted an accumulation fund of</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> more than 250 million </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">yu</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">an, </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">published </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">381 SCI papers</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> and has been granted </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">196 invention patents</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">. Besides, it has earned</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> 2 provincial and ministerial scientific research achievements awards.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"><br></span></p>
<p style="margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">S</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">A</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">ST focuses on </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">both </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">theory and practice, and builds a space science and technology experiment center. It has become an incubator for high-level scientific research achievements and a training base for top-notch innovative talents. SAST pays attention to the cooperation</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> with institutions</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">I</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">n order to cultivate innovative talents, </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">SAST</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> co-built the Qian Xuesen Space Science Talent Training Base with Qian Xuesen Space Technology Laboratory, the Joint Research Center of Near Space Vehicle Measurement and Control and Special Measurement Technology with the Key Laboratory of Space Physics, and the Joint Innovation Laboratory of Space Measurement, Control and Communication Technology with Beijing Institute of Telemetry. SAST focuses on extensive academic exchanges and cooperation with famous universities and scientific research institutions at home and abroad, and invites many academicians, experts and scholars at home and abroad to give lectures in </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">the</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">school</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"><br></span></p>
<p style="margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;"></span>Homepage: <a href="https://sast.xidian.edu.cn/English/Home.htm">https://sast.xidian.edu.cn/English/Home.htm</a></span></p>
